# Merge strategies for the files every PR appends to.
#
# `union` keeps BOTH sides' lines instead of raising a conflict. It is correct
# only for a flat, append-only list whose lines do not depend on their
# neighbours, and where a wrong result is caught by something. Do NOT add prose
# here: a union merge of two build-log entries interleaves them into nonsense.
#
# It is also NOT a fix for a colliding NUMBER. Two sessions that both take
# migration 0311, or both take ADR 0048, merge cleanly and are both wrong.
# See conventions.md section 11.

tests/db-backed-files.ts    merge=union
docs/decisions/README.md    merge=union
